proc #(x:any^extent(7))=shape([_lbound1(x).._ubound1(x),_lbound2(x).._ubound2(x),_lbound3(x).._ubound3(x),_lbound4(x).._ubound4(x),_lbound5(x).._ubound5(x),_lbound6(x).._ubound6(x),_lbound7(x).._ubound7(x)])

proc _get_array_element(a:any^any,t:tuple(int))=_get_aelem(a,t) check "Rank of index does not match the rank of the array"=>rank(t)==rank(a)
proc _set_array_element(&a:any^any,t:tuple(int),v):PM__setaelem(&a,t,v) check "Rank of index does not match the rank of the array"=>rank(t)==rank(a)
proc _set_array_multi_element(&a:any^any,t:tuple(int),v):PM__setaelem(&a,t,v) check "Rank of index does not match the rank of the array"=>rank(t)==rank(a)
proc _get_array_elementz(a:any^any,t:tuple(int))=_get_aelem(a,t)
proc _set_array_elementz(&a:any^any,t:tuple(int),v):PM__setaelem(&a,t,v)
proc _set_array_multi_elementz(&a:any^any,t:tuple(int),v):PM__setaelem(&a,t,v)
proc _make_subref(a:any^any,t:tuple(int))=_make_subref(a,_point2list(t))
PM__intrinsic _make_subref(a:any^any,i:PM__list)->(*) : "make_rf"

PM__else

PM__intrinsic<<needs_type>> _array(x:any,y:any,z:any)->(*) : "array"
PM__intrinsic<<needs_type>> _varray(x:any,y:any,z:any)->(*) : "var_array"
PM__intrinsic _array_mshape(x:any^any)->(*) : "get_dom"
PM__intrinsic _get_aelem(x:any^any,y:int)->(*) : "array_get_elem"
PM__intrinsic<<uses_amps>> PM__setaelem(&x:any^any,y:int,z:any): "array_set_elem"
PM__intrinsic<<uses_amps>> PM__setmaelem(&x:any^any,y:int,z:any): "array_set_multi_elem"
proc array(x,d:extent)=_array(x,_mshape(d),size(d))
proc varray(x,d:extent)=_varray(x,_mshape(d),size(d))
proc #(x:any^any)=_array_mshape(x)._extent
proc _get_array_element(a:any^any,t:tuple(int))=_get_aelem(a,_point2index(_array_mshape(a),t))
proc _set_array_element(&a:any^any,t:tuple(int),v):PM__setaelem(&a,_point2index(_array_mshape(a),t),v)
proc _set_array_multi_element%(&a:any^any,t:tuple(int),v):PM__setmaelem(&a,_point2index(_array_mshape(PM__import%(a)),t),v)
proc _get_array_elementz(a:any^any,t:tuple(int))=_get_aelem(a,_point2index(_array_mshape(a)._extent,t))
proc _set_array_elementz(&a:any^any,t:tuple(int),v):PM__setaelem(&a,_point2index(_array_mshape(a)._extent,t),v)
proc _set_array_multi_elementz%(&a:any^any,t:tuple(int),v):PM__setmaelem(&a,_point2index(PM__import%(_array_mshape(a)._extent),t),v)
proc _make_subref(a:any^any,t:tuple(int))=_make_subref(a,_point2index(_array_mshape(a),t))
proc _make_subrefz(a:any^any,t:tuple(int))=_make_subref(a,_point2index(_array_mshape(a)._extent,t))
PM__intrinsic _make_subref(a:any^any,i:int)->(*) : "make_rf"

PM__endif

PM__intrinsic size(x:any^any)->(int) : "get_size"

proc _arb(x:any^any)=undef(_get_aelem(x,0))
proc extent(x:any^any)=#x

proc rank(x:any^extent(1))=1
proc rank(x:any^extent(2))=2
proc rank(x:any^extent(3))=3
proc rank(x:any^extent(4))=4
proc rank(x:any^extent(5))=5
proc rank(x:any^extent(6))=6
proc rank(x:any^extent(7))=7

type _mshape(ndim:dimension_number,contig:literal(bool)) is rec {_extent:extent(ndim),_m:tuple(int,ndim),_n:int,_o:int,_c:contig}
proc _mshape(g:extent(1))=rec _mshape{_extent=g,_m=[1],_n=size(g.1),_o=o,_c=true} where o=-_point2index(sizes(g),low(g))
proc _mshape(g:extent(2))=rec _mshape{_extent=g,_m=[1,s1],_n=s1*size(g.2),_o=o,_c=true} where s1=size(g.1) where o=-_point2index(sizes(g),low(g))
proc _mshape(g:extent(3))=rec _mshape{_extent=g,_m=[1,s1,s2],_n=s2*size(g.3),_o=o,_c=true} where s2=s1*size(g.2) where s1=size(g.1) where o=-_point2index(sizes(g),low(g))
proc _mshape(g:extent(4))=rec _mshape{_extent=g,_m=[1,s1,s3,s3],_n=s3*size(g.4),_o=o,_c=true} where s3=s2*size(g.3) where s2=s1*size(g.2) where s1=size(g.1) where o=-_point2index(sizes(g),low(g))
proc _mshape(g:extent(5))=rec _mshape{_extent=g,_m=[1,s1,s2,s3,s4],_n=s4*size(g.5),_o=o,_c=true} where s4=s3*size(g.4) where s3=s2*size(g.3) where s2=s1*size(g.2) where s1=size(g.1) where o=-_point2index(sizes(g),low(g))
proc _mshape(g:extent(6))=rec _mshape{_extent=g,_m=[1,s1,s2,s3,s4,s5],_n=s5*size(g.6),_o=o,_c=true}  where s5=s4*size(g.5) where s4=s3*size(g.4) where s3=s2*size(g.3) where s2=s1*size(g.2) where s1=size(g.1) where o=-_point2index(sizes(g),low(g))
proc _mshape(g:extent(7))=rec _mshape{_extent=g,_m=[1,s1,s2,s3,s4,s5,s6],_n=s6*size(g.7),_o=o,_c=true} where s6=s5*size(g.6) where s5=s4*size(g.5) where s4=s3*size(g.4) where s3=s2*size(g.3) where s2=s1*size(g.2) where s1=size(g.1) where o=-_point2index(sizes(g),low(g))


//  Linear index of mshape (zero base,unit stride)
proc _point2index(g:_mshape,p:tuple(any_int))=_point2index(g,int(p))
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(1,literal(true)),p:tuple(int,1))=g._o+g._m.1*p.1
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(2,literal(true)),p:tuple(int,2))=g._o+g._m.1*p.1+g._m.2*p.2
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(3,literal(true)),p:tuple(int,3))=g._o+g._m.1*p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(4,literal(true)),p:tuple(int,4))=g._o+g._m.1*p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3+g._m.4*p.4
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(5,literal(true)),p:tuple(int,5))=g._o+g._m.1*p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3+g._m.4*p.4+g._m.5*p.5
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(6,literal(true)),p:tuple(int,6))=g._o+g._m.1*p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3+g._m.4*p.4+g._m.5*p.5+g._m.6*p.6
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(7,literal(true)),p:tuple(int,7))=g._o+g._m.1*p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3+g._m.4*p.4+g._m.5*p.5+g._m.6*p.6+g._m.7*p.7
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(1,literal(false)),p:tuple(int,1))=g._o+p.1
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(2,literal(false)),p:tuple(int,2))=g._o+p.1+g._m.2*p.2
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(3,literal(false)),p:tuple(int,3))=g._o+p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(4,literal(false)),p:tuple(int,4))=g._o+p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3+g._m.4*p.4
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(5,literal(false)),p:tuple(int,5))=g._o+p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3+g._m.4*p.4+g._m.5*p.5
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(6,literal(false)),p:tuple(int,6))=g._o+p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3+g._m.4*p.4+g._m.5*p.5+g._m.6*p.6
proc _point2index(g:_mshape(7,literal(false)),p:tuple(int,7))=g._o+p.1+g._m.2*p.2+g._m.3*p.3+g._m.4*p.4+g._m.5*p.5+g._m.6*p.6+g._m.7*p.7
proc _point2index(g:_mshape,p:tuple(int))=0: compile_error("Rank mismatch in index")

//  Linear index of tuple of ranges or ints (zero base)
proc _indx(g:range(int),s)=int(s)
proc _indx(g:any_int,s)=int(s)
proc _sz(x:int)=x
proc _sz(x:range(int))=x._n
proc _point2index(g:tuple(int,1)|extent(1),s:any_int)=int(_indx(g.1,s))
proc _point2index(g:tuple(int,1)|extent(1),s:tuple(any_int,1))=int(_indx(g.1,s.1))
proc _point2index(g:tuple(int,2)|extent(2),s:tuple(any_int,2))=int(_indx(g.1,s.1)+_sz(g.1)*_indx(g.2,s.2))
proc _point2index(g:tuple(int,3)|extent(3),s:tuple(any_int,3))=int(_indx(g.1,s.1)+_sz(g.1)*(_indx(g.2,s.2)+_sz(g.2)*_indx(g.3,s.3)))
proc _point2index(g:tuple(int,4)|extent(4),s:tuple(any_int,4))= int(_indx(g.1,s.1)+_sz(g.1)* (_indx(g.2,s.2)+_sz(g.2)* (_indx(g.3,s.3)+_sz(g.3)* _indx(g.4,s.4))))
proc _point2index(g:tuple(int,5)|extent(5),s:tuple(any_int,5))= int(_indx(g.1,s.1)+_sz(g.1)* (_indx(g.2,s.2)+_sz(g.2)* (_indx(g.3,s.3)+_sz(g.3)* (_indx(g.4,s.4)+_sz(g.4)* _indx(g.5,s.5)))))
proc _point2index(g:tuple(int,6)|extent(6),s:tuple(any_int,6))= int(_indx(g.1,s.1)+_sz(g.1)* (_indx(g.2,s.2)+_sz(g.2)* (_indx(g.3,s.3)+_sz(g.3)* (_indx(g.4,s.4)+_sz(g.4)* (_indx(g.5,s.5)+_sz(g.5)* _indx(g.6,s.6))))))
proc _point2index(g:tuple(int,7)|extent(7),s:tuple(any_int,7))= int(_indx(g.1,s.1)+_sz(g.1)* (_indx(g.2,s.2)+_sz(g.2)* (_indx(g.3,s.3)+_sz(g.3)* (_indx(g.4,s.4)+_sz(g.4)* (_indx(g.5,s.5)+_sz(g.5)* (_indx(g.6,s.6)+_sz(g.6)* (_indx(g.7,s.7))))))))

proc _index2point(i:int,s:range(int))=[i+s._lo]
proc _index2point(i:int,s:int)=[i]
proc _index2point(i:int,s:tuple(int,1))=[i]
proc _index2point(i:int,s:tuple(int,2))=[i1,i2] where i1=i-i2*_sz(s.1) where i2=i/_sz(s.1)
proc _index2point(i:int,s:tuple(int,3))=[i1,i2,i3] where i1=i-j2*_sz(s.1) where i2=j2-i3*_sz(s.2) where i3=j2/_sz(s.2) where j2=i/_sz(s.1)
proc _index2point(i:int,s:tuple(int,4))=[i1,i2,i3,i4] where i1=i-j2*_sz(s.1) where i2=j2-j3*_sz(s.2) where i3=j3-i4*_sz(s.3) where i4=j3/_sz(s.3) where j3=j2/_sz(s.2) where j2=i/_sz(s.1) 
proc _index2point(i:int,s:tuple(int,5))=[i1,i2,i3,i4,i5] where i1=i-j2*_sz(s.1) where i2=j2-j3*_sz(s.2) where i3=j3-j4*_sz(s.3) where i4=j4-i5*_sz(s.4) where i5=j4/_sz(s.4) where j4=j3/_sz(s.3) where j3=j2/_sz(s.2) where j2=i/_sz(s.1)  
proc _index2point(i:int,s:tuple(int,6))=[i1,i2,i3,i4,i5,i6] where i1=i-j2*_sz(s.1) where i2=j2-j3*_sz(s.2) where i3=j3-j4*_sz(s.3) where i4=j4-j5*_sz(s.4) where i5=j5-i6*_sz(s.5) where i6=j5/_sz(s.5) where j5=j4/_sz(s.4) where j4=j3/_sz(s.3) where j3=j2/_sz(s.2) where j2=i/_sz(s.1)  
proc _index2point(i:int,s:tuple(int,7))=[i1,i2,i3,i4,i5,i6,i7] where i1=i-j2*_sz(s.1) where i2=j2-j3*_sz(s.2) where i3=j3-j4*_sz(s.3) where i4=j4-j5*_sz(s.4) where i5=j5-j6*_sz(s.5) where i6=j6-i7*_sz(s.6) where i7=j6/_sz(s.6) where j6=j5/_sz(s.5) where j5=j4/_sz(s.4) where j4=j3/_sz(s.3) where j3=j2/_sz(s.2) where j2=i/_sz(s.1)

// ***************************************************
// ARRAY SLICES
// ***************************************************

type array_slice(a,s) is PM__ref slice(a,s)
proc _arb(x:array_slice)=_arb(x^{2})
proc #(x:array_slice)=#(x^{3})
proc #(x:array_slice(any^_dshape))=_dshape_slice(d,d._mshape._extent#x^{3}) where d=#(x^{2})
proc conform(x:_mshape,y:array_slice)=map_reduce($_conform,$and,x,y^{3})
proc conform(x:_dshape,y:array_slice)=map_reduce($_conform,$and,x._mshape,y^{3})
proc conform(x,y:array_slice)=map_reduce($_conform,$and,#x,y^{3})
proc sizes(x:array_slice)=dims(x^{3})
proc size(x:array_slice)=size(x^{3})
proc element(x:array_slice(any^any,),y:index)=element(x^{2},x^{3}[y])
proc element(x:array_slice,y:subs)=PM__ref slice (
    x^{1},x^{2},x^{3}[y]
)
proc _set_elem(&x:array_slice(any^any,),v,y:tuple(int)) {
  PM__setaelem(&^(x^{2}),index(#(x^{2}),x^{3}[y]),v)
}
proc PM__dup(x:array_slice(any^any,))->(){
  var a=array(_arb(x),#x)
  a=x
  return a
}

proc PM__dup(x:array_slice(any^_dshape))->(){
  let d=#x^{2}
  let ss=(#x^{2})._mshape#x^{3}
  var a=array(_arb(x^{2}),_dshape_slice(d,ss))
  _set_slice(&a._array,#(#a)._tile, PM__local(x^{2}),overlap((#x^{2})._tile,ss))
  return a
}


// ***************************************************
// DISTRIBUTED ARRAYS
// ***************************************************

type darray(e,d:dimension_number,ds:distr) is dvarray(e,d,ds),dfarray(e,d,ds)
type dvarray(e,d:dimension_number,ds:distr) is rec{_array:mvarray(e),_distr:ds}
type dfarray(e,d:dimension_number,ds:distr) is rec{_array:mfarray(e),_distr:ds}

proc array(elem:any,dom:distr(extent)|tuple(distr(range(any_int))|range(any_int)))=rec dfarray{_array=array(elem,#d._tile),_distr=d} where d=_dshape(dom)

type distributable is any_seq,extent,grid

type distr(d:distributable,ds:dist,topo:tuple(int|null),weight:null|marray(int)) is
    rec{base:d,dist:ds,topo:topo,weight:weight,disard:bool}

proc distr(base:distributable,topo:any=null|tuple(int|null),weight:null|marray(int)=null,discard=fix(false))=
    rec distr{base,dist=VBLOCK_DISTR,topo,weight,discard} {
        _check_topo(base,topo)
        _check_weight(base,weight)
    }

proc distr(base:distributable,dist:distr,topo:any=null|tuple(int|null),weight:null|marray(int)=null,discard=fix(false))=
    rec distr{base,dist,topo,weight,discard} {
        _check_topo(base,topo)
        _check_weight(base,weight)
    }

proc _check_topo(d,t): test  rank(d)==rank(t) else "Rank of topology does not equal rank of extent"
proc _check_topo(d,t:null) {}
proc _check_weight(d,e): test  rank(d)==rank(e) else "Rank of weight does not equal rank of extent"
proc _check_weight(d,e:null) {}

type PM__distr_tag is unique
type _dshape(d:dimension_number,ds:distr) is rec {_mshape:extent(d),_dist:dist,_tile,_isdist,_dtag:PM__distr_tag}

proc _dshape(d:distr)=_dshape(d.base,d.dist,d.topo,d.weight,d.discard)
proc _dshape(d:tuple(distr|any_seq))=_dshape(map($_get_base,d),map($_get_ds,d),null,null,false)
proc _get_base(d:distr)=d.base {
    test  d.topo is null else "Cannot set ""topo"" for a single dimension"
    test  d.weight is null else "Cannot set ""weight"" for a single dimension"
    test  d.discard is fix(false) else "Cannot set ""discard"" for a single dimension"
}
proc _get_base(d)=d
proc _get_ds(d:distr)=d.dist
proc _get_ds(d)=d

proc _dshape(d,ds,topol,weight,discard)->() {
  let sized=size(d)
  let dd=dims(d)
  let topo=_topo(topol,ds,dd, min(sized,shrd_nnode()))
  let dist=distribute(ds,dd,topo)
  let small=sized<shrd_nnode() 
  if small or discard {  
      test   size(#dist)<=shrd_nnode() else "Not enough processors to implement distribution"
  } else {
      test   size(#dist)!=shrd_nnode() else "Size of distribution does not match number of available nodes"
  }
  let p=_shrd_node()
  let elem...
  if small {
      let pp=_workshare(weight,d,topo,shrd_nnode())
      elem=element(dist,pp)
  } elseif discard {
      if p<size(topo) {
          elem=element(dist,p)
      } else {
          elem=empty(dist)
      }
  } else {
      elem=element(dist,p)
  }
  return rec _dshape {
      _mshape=d,_dist=dist,_tile=elem,_isdist=shrd_nnode()<=1
  }
}

PM__intrinsic<<is_impure>> _get_dims(int,int)->(int) : "get_dims"
PM__intrinsic<<is_impure>> _get_dims(int,int,int)->(int,int) : "get_dims"
PM__intrinsic<<is_impure>> _get_dims(int,int,int,int)->(int,int,int) : "get_dims"
PM__intrinsic<<is_impure>> _get_dims(int,int,int,int,int)->(int,int,int,int) : "get_dims"
PM__intrinsic<<is_impure>> _get_dims(int,int,int,int,int,int)->(int,int,int,int,int) : "get_dims"
PM__intrinsic<<is_impure>> _get_dims(int,int,int,int,int,int,int)->(int,int,int,int,int,int) : "get_dims"
PM__intrinsic<<is_impure>> _get_dims(int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int)->(int,int,int,int,int,int,int) : "get_dims"
proc _zd(x,y)=if(x==1=>1,nodes_needed(y,x))
proc _topo(dd:tuple,t:null,n:int)=_topo(dd,spread(VBLOCK,dd),n)
proc _topo(dd:tuple,t,n:int)=_topo(dd,spread(t,dd),n)
proc _topo(d:tuple1d,t:tuple1d,n:int)=tuple(_get_dims(n,_zd(d.1,t.1)))
proc _topo(d:tuple2d,t:tuple2d,n:int)=tuple(b,a) where a,b=_get_dims(n,_zd(d.2,t.2),_zd(d.1,t.1))
proc _topo(d:tuple3d,t:tuple3d,n:int)=tuple(c,b,a) where a,b,c=_get_dims(n,_zd(d.3,t.3),_zd(d.2,t.2),_zd(d.1,t.1))
proc _topo(d:tuple4d,t:tuple4d,n:int)=tuple(dd,c,b,a) where a,b,c,dd=_get_dims(n,_zd(d.4,t.4),_zd(d.3,t.3),_zd(d.2,t.2),_zd(d.1,t.1))
proc _topo(d:tuple5d,t:tuple5d,n:int)=tuple(e,dd,c,b,a) where a,b,c,dd,e=_get_dims(n,_zd(d.5,t.5),_zd(d.4,t.4),_zd(d.3,t.3),_zd(d.2,t.2),_zd(d.1,t.1))
proc _topo(d:tuple6d,t:tuple6d,n:int)=tuple(f,e,dd,c,b,a) where a,b,c,dd,e,f=_get_dims(n,_zd(d.6,t.6),_zd(d.5,t.5),_zd(d.4,t.4),_zd(d.3,t.3),_zd(d.2,t.2),_zd(d.1,t.1))
proc _topo(d:tuple7d,t:tuple7d,n:int)=tuple(g,f,e,dd,c,b,a) where a,b,c,dd,e,f,g=_get_dims(n,_zd(d.7,t.7),_zd(d.6,t.6),_zd(d.5,t.5),_zd(d.4,t.4),_zd(d.3,t.3),_zd(d.2,t.2),_zd(d.1,t.1))

proc _workshare(work:null,d,dist,nnode:int,snode:int,nsnode:int)=nnode*(2*snode+1)/(2*nsnode)
proc _workshare(work:marray(int),d,dist,nnode:int,snode:int,nsnode:int)->() {
  test  conform(#work,#d) else "work array does not conform to mshape"
  var wk=work
  return _wshare(wk,nnode,snode,nsnode) 
}
PM__intrinsic _wshare(int^any,int,int,int)->(int) : "wshare"


//***************************************************
// DISTRIBUTIONS
// ***************************************************

type dist_dim is no_dist,direct_dist,block_dist,vblock_dist,cyclic_dist,block_cyclic_dist
type dist is null,blocked_dist,dist_dim,tuple(dist_dim),sliced_dist
type blocked_dist is block_dist,vblock_dist,tuple(block_dist|vblock_dist)
type dist_template is null,dist_template_dim,tuple(dist_template_dim),...
type dist_template_dim is null,vblock_template,direct_template,block_template,cyclic_template,block_cyclic_template,...
    
//  Null distribution (mirroring)
proc distribute(dis:null,d:int,t:int,p:int)=no_dist(d,t,p)
type no_dist is rec {_hi:int,_p:int,_pr:int}
proc nodes_needed(d:null,g:int)=1
proc no_dist(g:int,d:int,p:int)=rec no_dist {
  _hi=int(g),_p=int(d),_pr=p
}
proc #(b:no_dist)=shape([0..b._p-1])
proc _shp(b:no_dist)=0..b._p-1
proc sizes(b:no_dist)=[b._p]
proc size(b:no_dist)=b._p
proc element(b:no_dist,i:int)=0..b._hi-1
proc tile_size(b:no_dist,i:int)=b._hi
proc empty(b:no_dist)=1..0
proc unit(b:no_dist)=0..0
proc nodes_for_grid(b:no_dist,g:seq(int))=b._pr..b._pr
proc node_for(b:no_dist,j:int)=b._pr
proc index(b:no_dist,j:int,p:int)=j
proc node_nhd(b:no_dist,p:int,d:range(int))=p..p
proc node_co_nhd(b:no_dist,p:int,d:range(int))=p..p

//  Direct distribution (1-1 map to processor topology)
type direct_dist is rec {_p:int}
type direct_template is unique{DIRECT_DIST}
proc distribute(dis:direct_template,d:int,t:int,p:int)=direct_dist(d)
proc nodes_needed(d:direct_template,g:int)=g
proc direct_dist(d:int)=rec direct_dist {
  _p=int(d)
}
proc #(b:direct_dist)=shape([0..b._p-1])
proc _shp(b:direct_dist)=0..b._p-1
proc sizes(b:direct_dist)=[b._p]
proc size(b:direct_dist)=b._p
proc element(b:direct_dist,i:int)=0..0
proc unit(b:direct_dist)=0..0
proc tile_size(b:direct_dist,i:int)=1
proc empty(b:direct_dist)=1..0
proc nodes_for_grid(b:direct_dist,g:seq(int))=int(g)
proc node_for(b:direct_dist,j:int)=j
//proc index(b:direct_dist,j:int,p:int)='0
proc node_nhd(b:direct_dist,p:int,d:int|range(int))=d+p
proc node_co_nhd(b:direct_dist,p:int,d:int|range(int))=-low(d)+p..-high(d)+p by -1

//  Variable block distribution
type vblock_dist is rec {_hi:int,_p:int}
type vblock_template is unique{VBLOCK_DIST}
proc distribute(dis:vblock_template,d:int,t:int,p:int)=vblock_dist(d,t)
proc nodes_needed(d:vblock_template,g:int)=0
proc vblock_dist(g:int,d:int)=rec vblock_dist {
  _hi=int(g),_p=int(d)
}
proc #(b:vblock_dist)=shape([0..b._p-1])
proc _shp(b:vblock_dist)=0..b._p-1
proc sizes(b:vblock_dist)=[b._p]
proc size(b:vblock_dist)=b._p
proc element(b:vblock_dist,i:int)=start..finish where finish=(ii+1)*b._hi/b._p-1 where start=ii*b._hi/b._p where ii=int(i)
proc tile_size(b:vblock_dist,i:int)=finish-start+1 where finish=(ii+1)*b._hi/b._p-1 where start=ii*b._hi/b._p where ii=int(i)
proc empty(b:vblock_dist)=1..0
proc unit(b:vblock_dist)=0..0
proc nodes_for_grid(b:vblock_dist,g:seq(int))=lo1..hi1 where lo1=_rdiv(b._p*(low(g)+1)-1,b._hi), hi1=_rdiv(b._p*(high(g)+1)-1,b._hi)
proc node_for(b:vblock_dist,j:int)=p where p=_rdiv(b._p*(j+1)-1,b._hi)
proc index(b:vblock_dist,j:int,p:int)=i where i=jj-s1 where s1=p*b._hi/b._p where jj=int(j)
proc node_nhd(b:vblock_dist,p:int,d:range(int))=p+(low(d)-bk+1)/bk..p+(high(d)+bk-1)/bk where bk=b._hi/b._p

//  fixed block distribution
type block_dist is rec {_b:int,_s:int,_p:int}
type block_template is unique{BLOCK_DIST}
proc distribute(dis:block_template,d:int,t:int,p:int)=block_dist(d,t)
proc nodes_needed(d:block_template,g:int)=0
proc block_dist(s:int,p:int)=rec block_dist {
_b=b,_s=s,_p=p} where b=(s+p-1)/p
proc #(b:block_dist)=shape([0..b._p-1])
proc _shp(b:block_dist)=0..b._p-1
proc sizes(b:block_dist)=[b._p]
proc size(b:block_dist)=b._p
proc element(b:block_dist,i:int)=start..finish where finish=min(b._s-1,(ii+1)*b._b-1) where start=ii*b._b where ii=int(i)
proc tile_size(b:block_dist,i:int)=finish-start+1 where finish=min(b._s-1,(ii+1)*b._b-1) where start=ii*b._b where ii=int(i)
proc empty(b:block_dist)=1..0
proc unit(b:block_dist)=0..0
proc nodes_for_grid(b:block_dist,g:seq(int))=lo1..hi1 where lo1=_rdiv(int(low(g)),b._b), hi1=_rdiv(int(high(g)),b._b)
proc node_for(b:block_dist,j:int)=p where p=_rdiv(jj,b._b) where jj=int(j)
proc index(b:block_dist,j:int,p:int)=i where i=jj-s1 where s1=p*b._b where jj=int(j)
proc node_nhd(b:block_dist,p:int,d:range(int))=p+(low(d)-b._b+1)/b._b..p+(high(d)+b._b-1)/b._b

//  Cyclic distribution
type cyclic_dist is rec {_hi:int,_p:int}
type cyclic_template is unique{CYCLIC_DIST}
proc distribute(dis:cyclic_template,d:int,t:int,p:int)=cyclic_dist(d,t)
proc nodes_needed(d:cyclic_template,g:int)=0
proc cyclic_dist(g:int,d:int)=rec cyclic_dist {
  _hi=int(g),_p=int(d)
}
proc #(b:cyclic_dist)=shape([0..b._p-1])
proc _shp(b:cyclic_dist)=0..b._p-1
proc sizes(b:cyclic_dist)=[b._p]
proc size(b:cyclic_dist)=b._p
proc element(b:cyclic_dist,i:int)= int(i)..b._hi-1 by b._p
proc tile_size(b:cyclic_dist,i:int)=(b._hi-1-int(i))/b._p+1
proc empty(b:cyclic_dist)=1..0 by 1
proc unit(b:cyclic_dist)=0..0 by 1
proc nodes_for_grid(b:cyclic_dist,g:seq(int))=cyclic_range(lo,high,p) where high=if(hi-lo>=p=>lo+p-1,hi+if(hi>lo=>0,p)) where lo=low(g) mod p,hi=high(g) mod p where p=b._p  
proc node_for(b:cyclic_dist,j:any_int)=p where p=int(j) mod b._p
proc index(b:cyclic_dist,j:int,p:int)=int(j)/b._p
proc node_nhd(b:cyclic_dist,p:int,d:range(int))=cyclic_range(p+low(d),p+high(d),b._p)

//  Block cyclic distribution
type block_cyclic_dist is rec {_hi:int,_p:int,_b:int,_s:int}
type block_cyclic_template is rec {block:int}
proc BLOCK_CYCLIC_DIST(block:int)=rec block_cyclic_template{
  block=block
}
proc distribute(dis:block_cyclic_template,d:int,t:int,p:int)=block_cyclic_dist(d,t,dis.block)
proc nodes_needed(d:block_cyclic_template,g:int)=0
proc block_cyclic_dist(g:int,p:int,b:int)=rec block_cyclic_dist {
_hi=int(g),_p=int(pp),_b=bb, _s=s} where s=pp*bb where bb=if(pp==1=>g,b) where pp=min((g+b-1)/b,p)
proc #(b:block_cyclic_dist)=shape([0..b._p-1])
proc _shp(b:block_cyclic_dist)=0..b._p-1
proc sizes(b:block_cyclic_dist)=[b._p]
proc size(b:block_cyclic_dist)=b._p
proc element(b:block_cyclic_dist,i:int)= block_seq(s,b._hi-1,b._s,b._b,0) where s=ii*b._b where ii=int(i)
proc tile_size(b:block_cyclic_dist,i:int)=nc*b._b+max(0,min(b._b,df-nc*b._s)) where nc=df/b._s where df=b._hi-s where s=ii*b._b where ii=int(i)
proc empty(b:block_cyclic_dist)=block_seq(1,0,1,1,0)
proc unit(b:block_cyclic_dist)=block_seq(0,1,1,1,0)
proc nodes_for_grid(b:block_cyclic_dist,g:grid_dim)=if(hi-lo+1<p=>cyclic_range(lo,hi,p),cyclic_range(0,p-1,p)) where lo=low(g)/b._b,hi=high(g)/b._b where p=b._p  
proc nodes_for_grid(b:block_cyclic_dist,g:seq)->(){
  var r=0..0
  if b._s==step(g) {
  r=nodes_for_grid(b,low(g)..low(g))} else {
    r=nodes_for_grid(b,low(g)..high(g))
  }
  return r
}
proc nodes_for_grid(b:block_cyclic_dist,g:block_seq)->(){
  let r...
  if b._s==step(g) {
      r=nodes_for_grid(b,low(g)..low(g)+width(g)-1)
  } else {
      r=nodes_for_grid(b,low(g)..high(g))
  }
  return r
}
proc node_for(b:block_cyclic_dist,j:int)=p where p=_rdiv(jj,b._b) mod b._p where jj=int(j)
proc index(b:block_cyclic_dist,j:int,p:int)=i where i=r+b._b*(s-p) where r=j-s*b._s where s=_rdiv(j,b._s)
proc node_nhd(b:block_cyclic_dist,p:int,d:range(int))=p+(low(d)-b._b+1)/b._b..p+(high(d)+b._b-1)/b._b
proc nodes_for_grid(b,g:any_int)=nodes_for_grid(b,g._t..g._t)

//  Tuple of distributions
proc distribute(dis:tuple(dist_template_dim),d:tuple(int),t:tuple(int))=map_dims($distribute,dis,d,t,p) where p=index2point(_this_node(),t)
proc distribute(dis:dist_template_dim,d:tuple(int),t:tuple(int))=map_dims($distribute,spread_dims(dis,d),d,t,p) where p=index2point(_this_node(),t)
proc distribute(dis:null,d:tuple(int),t:tuple(int))=distribute(VBLOCK,d,t)
proc nodes_needed(b:tuple(dist_template_dim),g:tuple(int))=map_dims($nodes_needed,b,g)
proc nodes_needed(b:dist_template_dim,g:tuple(int))=map_dims($nodes_needed,spread_dims(b,g),g)
proc node_for(b:tuple(dist_dim),j:tuple(int))=map_dims($node_for,b,j)
proc #(b:tuple(dist_dim))=shape(map_dims($_shp,b))
proc sizes(b:tuple(dist_dim))=map_dims($size,b)
proc element(b:tuple(dist_dim),i:tuple(int))=map_dims($element,b,i)
proc element(b:tuple(dist_dim),i:int)=element(b,_index2point(i,sizes(b)))
proc tile_size(b:tuple(dist_dim),i:tuple(int))=map_dims($tile_size,b,i)
proc empty(b:tuple(dist_dim))=map_dims($empty,b)
proc unit(b:tuple(dist_dim))=map_dims($unit,b)
proc nodes_for_grid(b:tuple(dist_dim),g:grid)=map_dims($nodes_for_grid,b,g)
proc node_num_for(b:tuple(dist_dim),j:tuple(int))=index(sizes(b),map_dims($node_for,b,j))
proc index(b:tuple(dist_dim),j:tuple(int),p:tuple(int))=index(tile_size(b,p),map_dims($index,b,j,p))
proc node_and_index(b:tuple(dist_dim),j:tuple(int))=index(sizes(b),p),i where i=index(tile_size(b,p),map_dims($index,b,j,p)) where p=map_dims($node_for,b,j) 
proc node_and_index(b:dist_dim,j:int)=p,i where i=index(b,j,p) where p=node_for(b,j)
proc node_nhd(b:tuple,p:tuple,d:tuple)=map_dims($node_nhd,b,p,d)
proc node_co_nhd(b:tuple,p:tuple,d:tuple)=map_dims($node_co_nhd,b,p,d)

//  Slice of a tuple of distributions
type sliced_dist(t,s) is rec{_t:t,_s:s}
proc sliced_dist(t:tuple(dist_dim),s:tuple(seq(int)|any_int(int)))=rec sliced_dist{
  _t=t,_s=s
}
proc node_for(t:sliced_dist,j:tuple(int))=node_for(t._t,t._s[j])
proc #(t:sliced_dist)=#t._t
proc sizes(t:sliced_dist)=sizes(t._t)
proc element(t:sliced_dist,i:tuple(int)|int)=overlap(t._s,element(t._t,i))
proc tile_size(t:sliced_dist,i:tuple(int)|int)=sizes(element(t,i))
proc empty(t:sliced_dist)=rec sliced_dist{
    _t=empty(t._t),_s=t._s
}
proc unit(t:sliced_dist)=rec sliced_dist{
    _t=unit(t._t),_s=t._s      /// NEEDS CORRECTING 
}
proc nodes_for_grid(t:sliced_dist,g:grid)=nodes_for_grid(t._t,t._s[g])
proc node_num_for(t:sliced_dist,j:tuple(int))=node_num_for(t._t,t._s[j])
proc index(t:sliced_dist,j:tuple(int),p:tuple(int))=index(tile_size(t,p),element(t,p)#j)
proc node_and_index(t:sliced_dist,j:int)=p,i where i=index(t,j,p) where p=node_for(t,j)
proc node_nhd(t:sliced_dist,p:tuple,d:tuple)=node_nhd(t._t,p,_stpmult(d,t._s))
proc node_co_nhd(t:sliced_dist,p:tuple,d:tuple)=node_co_nhd(t._t,p,_stpmult(d,t._s))
proc _stpmult(d:tuple,s:tuple)=map_dims($_stpmult,d,s)
proc _stpmult(d:range,s:range)=d
proc _stpmult(d:range,s:seq)=if(st>0=>st*low(d)..st*high(d),st*high(d)..st*low(d)) where st=step(s)


// *************************************************
//  ARRAY & SLICE ASSIGNMENT
// *************************************************

proc PM__assign(&xx:array,x:any) {
  check_assign_types(_arb(xx),x)
  _set_array(&xx,x)
}

proc PM__assign(&xx:array,x:array) {
  _array_assign(&xx,x,same_type(_arb(x),_arb(xx)))
}

proc PM__assign_var(&xx:array,x:any) {
  check_assign_types(_arb(xx),x)
  _set_array(&xx,x)
}

proc PM__assign_var(&xx:array,x:array) {
  _array_assign(&xx,x,same_type(_arb(x),_arb(xx)))
}

proc PM__aliased_assign(&xx,x){
}

proc PM__aliased_assign(&xx:array_slice,x:array_slice) <<inline>> {
  _assign_internal_slice(&xx,x^{2})
}

proc _array_assign(&xx,x,v:fix(false)){
  check_assign_types(_arb(xx),x)
  _set_array(&xx,x)
}

proc _array_assign(&xx,x,v:fix(true)){
  check_conform(extent(xx),extent(x))
  _copy_array(&xx,x)
}

// This needs to work with copying varrays at different levels
proc _array_assign(&xx:varray,x,v:fix(true)) {
  _assign_element(&xx,x)
}

proc _set_array(&xx,y) {
  for &i in xx: i=y 
}

proc _copy_array(&xx,x) {
  for &i in xx,j in extent(x): i=x[j]  
}


/*

PM__if_compiling
proc _set_slice(&x,a,y,b) {
  foreach i in a,j in b:x[i]=y[j]
}
PM__else
proc _set_slice(&x,a,y,b) {
  if size(a)>0:for i in a,j in b{
    sync x[i]=y[j]
  }
}
PM__endif

type _non_d is any^any,array_slice(any^any,)
proc _set_array(&x:any^any,y){
  for &i in x {
    _assign(&i,y) 
  }
}
   
proc _set_array(&x:darray,y){
  _set_array(&x._array,y)
}

proc _set_array(&x:array_slice(any^any,),y){
  let d=x^{2}
  for i in d {
    _set_elem(&x^{2},y,i <<PM__ignore>>) 
  }
}

proc _set_array(&x:array_slice(darray,y){
  let tile=x^{2}._dist._tile
  let t=overlap(tile,x^{2}._extent#x^{3})
  for i in t {
    _set_elem(&x^{2}._array,y,i <<PM__ignore>>) 
  }
}
   
proc _copy_array(&a:_non_d,b:_non_d)->(){
  for &i in a, j in b {
    i=j
  }
  return fix(false)
}

proc _copy_array(&xx:any^_dshape,x:_non_d)->() {
  let tile=xx._dist._tile
  for i in tile {
    PM__setaelem(&xx._array,index(sizes(tile),here),x[(#x)[i]] <<PM__ignore>>)
  }
  return fix(false) 
}

proc _copy_array(&xx:array_slice(any^_dshape,),x:_non_d)->() {
  let tile=xx^{2}._dist._tile
  let subtile,subarray=overlap(tile,xx^{2}._dist._extent#xx^{3})
  for i in subtile,j in subarray {
    PM__setaelem(&xx^{2}._array,index(sizes(tile),i),x[element(#x,active_dims(xx^{3},j))] <<PM__ignore>>) 
  }
  return fix(false) 
}
 
proc _copy_array(&a:_non_d,x:any^_dshape)->() {
  let dist=(#x).dist
  foreach p in #(dist) {
    let tile=element(dist,p)
    let i=index(dims(dist),p)
    if i==_shrd_node() {
      for kk in PM__local(x),j in tile {
        var k=kk
        _bcast_shrd(&k,i)
        _set_elem(&a,k,(#a)[j] <<PM__ignore>>) 
      }
    } else {
      for j in tile {
        var k=_arb(a)
        _bcast_shrd(&k,i)
        _set_elem(&a,k,(#a)[j] <<PM__ignore>>)
      }
    }
  }
  return fix(false)
}
                                                                             
proc _copy_array(&v:_non_d,x:array_slice(any^_dshape,))->() {
  let dist=(#(x^{2})).dist
  let xs=(#(x^{2}))._mshape#x^{3}
  let nodes=#dist
  foreach pp in overlap(nodes,nodes_for_grid(dist,xs)) {
    let p=nodes[pp]
    let utile,elem=overlap(dist[nodes[p]],xs)
    let i=index(dims(dist),p)
    if i==_shrd_node() {
      for j in utile, jj in elem {
        var k=element(PM__local(x^{2}),j)
        _bcast_shrd(&k,i)
        _set_elem(&v,k,element(#v,active_dims(x^{3},jj)) <<PM__ignore>>) 
      }
    } else {
      for j in elem {
        var k=_arb(x^{2})
        _bcast_shrd(&k,i)
        _set_elem(&v,k,element(#v,active_dims(x^{3},j)) <<PM__ignore>>) 
      }
    }
  }
  return fix(false)
}


type _comp is contains(array|*any|PM__ref(any))
proc _copy_array(&xx:array_slice(any^_dshape,),x:array_slice(any^_dshape))->() {
  _copy_darray_slice(&xx^{2}._array,xxd,xxd._mshape#xx^{3}, PM__local(x^{2}),xd,xd._mshape#x^{3},xd._tile) where xxd=#(xx^{2}),xd=#(x^{2})
  return fix(true)
}
    
proc _copy_array(&xx:any^_dshape,x:array_slice(any^_dshape))->() {
  _copy_darray_slice(&xx._array,xxd,zero_base(xxd._mshape._extent), PM__local(x^{2}),xd,xd._mshape#x^{3},xd._tile) where xxd=#xx,xd=#(x^{2})
  return fix(true)
}
    
proc _copy_array(&xx:array_slice(any^_dshape,),x:any^_dshape)->() {
  _copy_darray_slice(&xx^{2}._array,xxd,xxd._mshape#xx^{3}, PM__local(x),xd,zero_base(xd._mshape._extent),xd._tile) where xxd=#(xx^{2}),xd=#x
  return fix(true)
}
    
proc _copy_array(&xx:any^_dshape,x:any^_dshape)->() {
  _copy_darray_slice(&xx._array,xxd,zero_base(xxd._mshape._extent), PM__local(x),xd,zero_base(xd._mshape._extent),xd._tile) where xxd=#xx,xd=#x
  return fix(true)
}
    
proc _assign_internal_slice(&xx:array_slice(any^any),s)->() {
  let x=rec array_slice{
    _a=xx^{2},_s=s
  }
  xx=x
}
proc _assign_internal_slice(&xx:array_slice(any^_dshape),s) {
  let xxd=#(xx^{2})
  let xxs=xxd._mshape#xx^{3}
  let xs=xxd._mshape#s
  let ltile=intersect(xxd._tile,xs)
  let ls=#ltile
  var x=array(_arb(xx),ls)
  _set_slice(&x,ls,PM__local(xx^{2}),overlap(xxd._tile,ltile))
  _copy_darray_slice(&xx^{2}._array,xxd,xxs, x,xxd,xxd._mshape#s,ltile)
}
    
proc _copy_darray_slice(&xx,newd,xxs,x,oldd,xs,otile) {
  _push_node_dist()
  let oldpart,oldtile=overlap(xs,oldd._tile)
  let newpart,newtile=overlap(xxs,newd._tile)
  if size(newpart)>0:foreach pp in nodes_for_grid(oldd.dist,element(xs,active_dims(xxs,newpart))) {
    let p=index(dims(oldd.dist),pp)
    if p/=_this_node() {
      let tile=element(xxs,active_dims(xs,overlap(xs,element(oldd.dist,p))))
      let ov=overlap(newd._tile,tile)
      if size(ov)>0:_recv_slice(p,&xx,ov)
    }
  }
  if size(oldpart)>0:foreach pp in nodes_for_grid(newd.dist,element(xxs,active_dims(xs,oldpart))) {
    let p=index(dims(newd.dist),pp)
    if p/=_this_node() {
      let tile=element(xs,active_dims(xxs,overlap(xxs,element(newd.dist,p))))
      let ov=overlap(otile,tile)
      if size(ov)>0:_send_slice(p,x,ov)
    }
  }
  if size(newpart)>0 and size(oldpart)>0 {
    let oo,o=overlap(active_dims(xxs,newpart),active_dims(xs,oldpart))
    _set_slice(&xx,element(map($_xp,xxs,newtile),oo),x,element(map($_xp,xs,oldtile),o))
  }
  PM__pop_node(newd)
}
                     
proc _copy_darray_slice(&xx:_comp^any,newd,xxs,x,oldd,xs,otile) {
  _push_node_dist()
  let oldpart,oldtile=overlap(xs,oldd._tile)
  let newpart,newtile=overlap(xxs,newd._tile)
  if size(oldpart)>0:foreach pp in nodes_for_grid(newd.dist,element(xxs,active_dims(xs,oldpart))) {
    let p=index(dims(newd.dist),pp)
    if p/=_this_node() {
      let tile=element(xs,active_dims(xxs,overlap(xxs,element(newd.dist,p))))
      let ov=overlap(otile,tile)
      if size(ov)>0:_send_slice(p,x,ov)
    }
  }
  if size(newpart)>0 and size(oldpart)>0 {
    let oo,o=overlap(active_dims(xxs,newpart),active_dims(xs,oldpart))
    _set_slice(&xx,element(map($_xp,xxs,newtile),oo),x,element(map($_xp,xs,oldtile),o))
  }
  if size(newpart)>0:foreach pp in nodes_for_grid(oldd.dist,element(xs,active_dims(xxs,newpart))) {
    let p=index(dims(oldd.dist),pp)
    if p/=_this_node() {
      let tile=element(xxs,active_dims(xs,overlap(xs,element(oldd.dist,p))))
      let ov=overlap(newd._tile,tile)
      if size(ov)>0:_recv_slice_sync(p,&xx,ov)
    }
  }
  PM__pop_node(newd)
}
                     
proc _xp(x:any_int,y)=any_int(low(y))
proc _xp(x,y)=y

*/

// ***************************************************
// ARRAY OPERATIONS
// ***************************************************

//  Numeric array operations
proc -(x:num^any)={
  -xx:xx in x
}
proc +(x:num^any,y:num)={
  xx+y:xx in x
}
proc -(x:num^any,y:num)={
  xx-y:xx in x
}
proc *(x:num^any,y:num)={
  xx*y:xx in x
}
proc /(x:num^any,y:num)={
  xx/y:xx in x
}

// ***************************************************
// PROCESSOR SETS
// ***************************************************

type _pset is rec{first,rest,n}

proc _shrd_start(i,n,ns)=(2*i*ns+n-1)/(2*n)

proc _pset_subs(pset,distn,i,starts:null)=rec _pset{first,rest,n}
   where first=if(i==0=>pset.first,pset.rest+i-1),rest=rest+distn-1+s1,n=s2-s1
   where s1=_shrd_start(i,distn,pset.n), s2=_shrd_start(i+1,distn,pset.n)

proc _pset_subs(pset,distn,i,starts:farray)=rec _pset{first,rest,n}
   where first=if(i==0=>pset.first,pset.rest+i-1),rest=rest+distn-1+s1,n=s2-s1
   where s1=starts[i],s2=starts[i+1]



// ***************************************************
// LOOPS AND PARALLEL STATEMENTS
// ***************************************************

PM__if_compiling

PM__else

proc #(x:grid,y:tuple(any_int|range(any_int)|seq(any_int)))=map_dims($#,x,y)

proc PM__for_stmt(&PM__inout_a,PM__in_a,shape) yield(&any,any) <<inline>> {
    PM__for halo,size(shape),rank(shape),null {
      let shapei=#shape^PM__set_mode invar
      let schedule=shapei
      let here_in_tile=PM__generate(shapei,size(shape))^PM__set_mode priv
      let here=shapei[here_in_tile]
      let nullv=null
      PM__ref r_inouts=PM__import_list(PM__inouts)
      PM__ref r_inout_a=PM__each_index(i in num_elements(PM__inout_a):
          _get_lhs_elem%(PM__import_list(PM__inout_a)^*{i},here_in_tile))
      let nbhd=_nhd_desc(halo^PM__set_mode invar,shapei,shapei)
      PM__context nullv,nullv,shapei,schedule,here_in_tile,here,nbhd,null,_point2index(sizes(nbhd._tile),nbhd._tile#here) {
        PM__yield(&r_inouts,
          PM__import_list(PM__ins),
          &r_inout_a,
          PM__each_index(i in num_elements(PM__in_a):
              _get_elem%(PM__import_list(PM__in_a)^*{i},here_in_tile)) <<inline>>)
        PM__set_multi_elem%(&PM__inout_a,r_inout_a,here_in_tile <<PM__ignore>>)
      }
      must_compute(r_inouts)
      must_compute(r_inout_a)
   }
}

proc _get_elem%(x,h)=element(x,h)
proc _get_elem%(x:range(any_int)|seq(any_int),h)=PM__makeidxdim(x,1,h.1)^PM__set_mode idx
proc _get_elem%(x:tuple(range(any_int)|seq(any_int)|any_int) except tuple(any_int),h)
    =map_dims($PM__makeidxdim,x,dim_indices(x),expand_sizes(h,map_dims($_notint,x)))^PM__set_mode idx
proc _notint(x:any_int)=false
proc _notint(x)=true
proc _get_elem%(x:tuple(range(any_int)|seq(any_int)),h)=map_dims($PM__makeidxdim,x,dim_indices(x),h)^PM__set_mode idx
proc _get_elem%(x:any^any,h)=^_get_array_elementz(x,h)
proc _get_lhs_elem%(x:any^any,h)=^_get_array_elementz(x,h)
proc PM__set_multi_elem%(&x:PM__list,y,h):PM__each_index i in num_elements(x){PM__set_multi_elem%(&x^*{i},y^*{i},h <<PM__ignore>>)}
proc PM__set_multi_elem%(&x:any^any,y,h) {_set_array_multi_elementz%(&x,h,y)}
    
proc PM__for_stmt(&PM__inout_a,PM__in_a,shape)->() yield(&any,any)->(any) <<inline>> {
    var array...
    PM__for halo,size(shape),rank(shape),null {
      let shapei=PM__import%(shape)
      let schedule=PM__import%(#shape)
      let here_in_tile=PM__generate(shape,size(shape))^PM__set_mode priv 
      let here=shapei[here_in_tile]
      let nullv=null
      PM__context nullv,nullv,shapei {
          array=PM__export%(_make_array(PM__yield(&PM__inouts,
           PM__import%(PM__ins),
           &PM__inout_a,
           PM__get_elem(PM__import%(PM__in_a),here_in_tile)
           <<inline,PM__ignore>>),shapei))
      }
    }
    return array
}

proc region%()=PM__region^*{1}
proc subregion%()=PM__region^*{2}
proc here_in_tile%()=PM__region^*{3}
proc here%()=PM__region^*{4}
proc halo%()=PM__region^*{5}
proc loop_iter%()=PM__region^*{6}

proc PM__foreach_stmt(&PM__inout_a,PM__in_a,shape:extent(1)) yield(&any,any) <<inline>> {
    var index=low(shape.1)
    while index<=high(shape.1) {
        var inout_a=PM__get_elem(PM__inout_a,[index])  
        PM__yield(&PM__inouts,
           PM__ins,
           &inout_a,
           PM__get_elem(PM__in_a,[index])<<inline>>)
        PM__set_elem(&PM__inout_a,inout_a,[index])
        index=index+1
    }
}

proc PM__foreach_stmt(&PM__inout_a,PM__in_a,shape:extent(2)) yield(&any,any) <<inline>> {
    var index2=low(shape.2)
    while index2<=high(shape.2) {
      var index1=low(shape.1)
      while index1<=high(shape.1) {
        var inout_a=PM__get_elem(PM__inout_a,[index1,index2])  
        PM__yield(&PM__inouts,
           PM__ins,
           &inout_a,
           PM__get_elem(PM__in_a,[index1,index2]) <<inline>>)
        PM__set_elem(&PM__inout_a,inout_a,[index1,index2])
        index1=index1+1
      }
      index2=index2+1
    }
}



PM__intrinsic _make_array(any,any)->(*): "make_array"
proc PM__dash%(x:chan)=_make_array(x,PM__region)^PM__set_mode shrd

PM__endif

proc PM__par_stmt(num,work:any=null) yield() <<inline>> {  yield() }
proc PM__check_task%(num)=true

proc PM__chan_stmt() yield() { yield() }
proc PM__over_stmt%(x) yield() { yield() }

proc PM__check_iter(x)=x
proc PM__check_iter_amp(x)=^x
proc PM__check_iter(x,y){}
proc PM__check_iter_amp(x,y){}

